      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i tried rinsing it with water but it still feels pretty gritty and irritated. i really dont wanna go to the urgent care right now bc its expensive and my eye doesnt look that bad, just pink. if i just use a few drops of the antibiotic stuff i have, it should help kill any bacteria from the soap right? it would save me a trip to the doctor.",
