      "content": "i get what u mean about the resistance thing but these drops are literally already open and sitting in my cabinet, they aren't even that old. i'm just worried if i dont use them the soap might cause a tiny infection and then i'll *have* to go to the doctor. if i just use like two drops of the antibiotic ones, surely that wont hurt anything? it seems way safer than leaving it irritated and hoping for the best.",
